  "T": "Truth of the record - missing, stale, unverified or contradicting facts; unknown stays unknown, nothing is made up",
  "A": "Your authority - only what you signed changes things: signatures, identity, property access, money approvals, forgery",
  "Y": "Choices that are yours - two of something or an unclear case; the system holds and asks, it never picks the likely one",
  "R": "Time and reliability - deadlines, overdue escalations, the clock, outages, capacity; when something breaks it stops loudly",
  "P": "People moments - an angry, upset or vulnerable person, a public complaint; a person answers, not a template"
 },
 "_tiers": {
  "1": "a failure could cost a license, money or a lawsuit",
  "2": "a failure could hurt a client relationship or your reputation",
  "3": "a failure slows the work"
